    "contract": {
        "name": "SwapTaxHook",
        "desc": "HookFee hook (points: BeforeSwap | Quote): a creator token tax. Takes `taxBps`\nof every swap input whose asset is in the taxed pair; the DEX pays it to this\napp, and the owner withdraws. The hook must be opted into each ASA it taxes.\nAny other subscribed point passes (v2 passResult pattern).",
